{"resourceIdentifier":"3225","resourceName":"Yingkou MSW Incineration and Power Generation Project","description":"Yingkou MSW Incineration and PowerGeneration Project (hereafterreferredto as the project) is located at Industrial Park of Metallurgy, Chemical Industry andHeavy equipment, Yantian District, Yingkou City, Liaoning Province, P.R.China. The Project is invested, constructed and operated by Yingkou Canvest Environmental Power Company Limited. (hereafter referred to as the project owner).\r\nThe purpose of the projectis to treat fresh MSW with two750t/d MSW combustion lines and utilize recovered waste heat for electricity generation. The MSW treatment system is composed of two 750t/d mechanical grate incinerators, matched withtwo sets of 15MW steam turbine and two sets of 15MW generators. The project will process 547,500 tons of MSW every year, and consume 120 tons of 0# light diesel as auxiliary fuel. The MSW combustion lines will work\r\n8,000 hoursand generate 204,800 MWh electricity every year, of which 167,940 MWh will be exported to the Northeast China Power Grid (NECPG).\r\nBy combusting MSW thatwould otherwise be disposed of at landfill, the project avoids the emission of methane that would be generated under landfilling condition. Meanwhile, by utilizing the waste heat from the MSW treatment system, the project could generate electricity to displace equivalent electricity supplied by NECPG which is dominated by fossil fuel-fired plants. The baseline scenario of the project is the sameas the scenario priorto the\r\nimplementation of the project, namely that the landfill gas is vented to atmosphere directly and the equivalent power is supplied by the NECPG.","location":{"latitude":40.601576,"longitude":121.359324},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-07-05","endExclusive":"2022-08-05","endInclusive":"2022-08-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3225"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yingkou Canvest Environmental Power Company Limited."},{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86-0417-2875557-805"},{"type":"string","value":"287082578@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3225"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"245456"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18/08/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/04/2021 - 14/04/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=66992&IDKEY=i8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0792381968","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Yingkou-VCS-Project-Description V01.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-23T10:57:31.533Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=67089&IDKEY=l0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9l92515731","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Yingkou Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-25T02:32:46.737Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95752&IDKEY=flksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098